# OpenSpec workflow

Before a feature or behavior change:

1. Read `openspec/specs/` for the area.
2. Read active work in `openspec/changes/`.
3. Run `/opsx-explore` before proposing or writing code.

End to end: spec → failing test → minimal code → run test. Sync with `/opsx-sync` after shipping; archive with `/opsx-archive` when asked.

